msgstr "原生 TOML 模式"

msgid "Failed to generate key: "
msgstr "生成密钥失败："

msgid "VPS Port (Optional)"
msgstr "VPS 映射端口 (可选)"

msgid "Target port on VPS for export / reminder. Does not affect client routing directly."
msgstr "服务端 VPS 对应开放的公网端口（用于备忘提示及一键导出服务端配置）。"

msgid "Test Connectivity"
msgstr "连通性测试"

msgid "Testing connectivity to VPS (%s)..."
msgstr "正在测试与 VPS (%s) 的网络连通性..."

msgid "Network connectivity diagnostic results for target server %s:"
msgstr "目标服务器 %s 网络连通性诊断结果："

msgid "Ping Latency:"
msgstr "Ping 延迟："

msgid "Reachable"
msgstr "连通正常"

msgid "Unreachable (ICMP Timeout / Blocked)"
msgstr "无法连通 (ICMP 超时或被防火墙拦截)"

msgid "Target Port:"
msgstr "目标端口："

msgid "Diagnostic Tips:"
msgstr "排障诊断建议："

msgid "If Ping succeeds but the client fails to connect, please verify whether port %s is permitted in your cloud VPS Security Group / Firewall."
msgstr "如果 Ping 延迟正常但无法建立连接，请重点核对公网 VPS 云厂商控制台的安全组（防火墙）是否放行了 %s 端口。"

msgid "If using Noise encryption, make sure the matching Private Key is configured on the VPS server.toml."
msgstr "如启用了 Noise 加密，请确保 VPS 端的 server.toml 正确配置了对应的服务端私钥。"

msgid "Ensure the Rathole server process is actively running on your VPS."
msgstr "确保 VPS 上的 Rathole 服务端进程正在正常运行中。"

msgid "VPS Connectivity Diagnostics"
msgstr "VPS 连通性网络诊断"

msgid "Diagnostic failed: "
msgstr "网络诊断失败："

msgid "Select target deployment format to export matching VPS configurations:"
msgstr "选择需要导出的 VPS 部署形式："

